/-!
# AME(5,2) for Formal Conjectures

A proof that an absolutely maximally entangled state of five qubits exists, against the
definitions of `FormalConjectures/OpenQuantumProblems/35.lean`. The witness is the five-qubit
ring graph state. The main result is `AME52.ame_5_2_exists` in `AME52/FormalTarget.lean`.
-/
